dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6636650Z     ├ The built-in Brotli certificate decompressor (enabled by the non-default
dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6636844Z       `brotli` crate feature) bounded the size of the decompressed output, but
dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6637197Z       accepted a peer-selected history window. Brotli's large-window extension was
dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6637416Z       enabled, so a five-byte header could cause an allocation of 1 GiB. A peer can
dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6637576Z       abort a process whose allocator cannot satisfy that request.
