dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6638367Z       - servers that enable the `brotli` feature and request client certificates.
dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6638438Z       
dependencies	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-14T13:42:32.6638636Z       Applications that do not enable the `brotli` feature are not affected.
